        "bodyText": "--jotdrop-test-boundary\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"model\"\r\n\r\ngpt-transcribe\r\n--jotdrop-test-boundary\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"languages[]\"\r\n\r\nnl\r\n--jotdrop-test-boundary\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"file\"; filename=\"recording.m4a\"\r\nContent-Type: audio/mp4\r\n\r\nfake m4a\r\n--jotdrop-test-boundary--\r\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "openai: binary bytes with CR, LF and dashes stay as they are; no language, no hint",
