        "text": "Read this receipt. Answer with one JSON object and nothing else. Use these fields, each only when it is on the receipt: title (a short name for what was bought, in the language of the receipt), shop, amount (the total as printed, without the currency), currency (an ISO 4217 code such as EUR), bought (the date of purchase as YYYY-MM-DD), warrantyUntil (as YYYY-MM-DD, only when the receipt states the end of a warranty). Do not guess and do not calculate dates."
      } }
